iffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[0,0,0,0.0],"cost_cuts":[2,2,0,2.06],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}]},"move":{"r1":-0.0296,"r5":-0.0154,"r1_spy":-0.0349,"r5_spy":-0.0162}}],"quotes":[{"c":"ONB 2018 Q2","e":"onb","d":"2018-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert G. Jones","x":"While we continue to benefit from this strong economic activity, as evidenced by our near-record loan pipeline, we do not know the impact that the implemented and proposed tariffs will have on our markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/23/old-national-bancorp-onb-q2-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2018 Q2","e":"onb","d":"2018-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert G. Jones","x":"The other side -- as I've mentioned briefly -- we still don't quite know the impact that tariffs will have.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/07/23/old-national-bancorp-onb-q2-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2018 Q3","e":"onb","d":"2018-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan","x":"As Bob noted, we expect the Klein systems conversion to occur in the second quarter of 2019 and the third quarter should reflect the full cost savings we've previously disclosed.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/22/old-national-bancorp-onb-q3-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2018 Q3","e":"onb","d":"2018-10-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Chris McGratty","x":"Are there any big investments that the Bank needs to make or should this be once we adjust for the kind of the cost savings that are targeted, this is the Bank that can grow expenses with inflation?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/22/old-national-bancorp-onb-q3-2018-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2018 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert G. Jones","x":"Some portions of our clients are directly impacted by the tariff wars such as agriculture, as well as some areas of manufacturing and housing that have shown some softness at the margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/old-national-bancorpin-onb-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2018 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert G. Jones","x":"You know the damper could potentially be the shutdown or tariffs or -- but for the most part, our clients just kind of move forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/old-national-bancorpin-onb-q4-2018-earnings-confer.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q1","e":"onb","d":"2019-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan III","x":"It's important to note that cost savings from the former KleinBank are already starting to be realized, and we remain on track for 40% annualized savings fully realized in the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/old-national-bancorp-onb-q1-2019-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q1","e":"onb","d":"2019-04-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendon Falconer","x":"We are pleased with our continued ability to control expenses and remain on track for the anticipated cost savings from our Klein partnership in the back half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/22/old-national-bancorp-onb-q1-2019-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q2","e":"onb","d":"2019-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan III","x":"As we shared last quarter, Klein systems converted smoothly, we've already realized cost savings during the quarter and our Minnesota operations continue to perform in line with expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/22/old-national-bancorp-onb-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q2","e":"onb","d":"2019-07-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brendon B. Falconer","x":"We realized some of the Klein Partnership cost savings following the April systems conversion and are on-track to capture the remainder in the back half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/22/old-national-bancorp-onb-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q3","e":"onb","d":"2019-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan III","x":"Today, we are moving toward redefining and restructuring the way we do business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/21/old-national-bancorp-onb-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q3","e":"onb","d":"2019-10-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan III","x":"We have fully integrated our Klein partnership and have realized all of the cost savings now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/21/old-national-bancorp-onb-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2020-01-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan","x":"Secondly, lay the foundation to be a top-performing independent bank by streamlining our operating model and strengthening our risk and credit processes to provide a seamless client experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/21/old-national-bancorp-onb-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2019 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2020-01-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan","x":"We will be a leading commercially oriented regional bank with a distinctive of client-centric value proposition based on strong relationships, a streamline operating model, an exceptional work environment that empowers our team members to deliver their best.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/21/old-national-bancorp-onb-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2020 Q1","e":"onb","d":"2020-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James C. Ryan","x":"Brendon will provide all the details, $but we are on track to deliver $22 million in cost savings in 2020 and achieve the full 40 million run rate to 2021 as we discussed on last quarter's call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/20/old-national-bancorp-onb-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ONB 2020 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2021-01-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Daryl D. Moore","x":"I think that the combination of government stimulus programs, cost cutting efforts by our borrowers and creative retooling by many of our clients have been key to keeping more borrowers from financial default.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/19/old-national-bancorp-onb-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ONB 2020 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2021-01-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Terry McEvoy","x":"…up earlier, given the acquisition that is occurring in some of your core markets, in some of the cost savings number that have publicly been talked about, would you be interested maybe at the end of this year in really ramping up some of your hiring may be in excess of what you were thinking…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/19/old-national-bancorp-onb-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ONB 2025 Q2","e":"onb","d":"2025-07-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jim Sandgren","x":"So I think there's some really encouraging things there when you think about tariffs and trade policies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/old-national-onb-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONB 2025 Q4","e":"onb","d":"2026-01-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Moran","x":"Expense guidance incorporates a full quarter run rate on Bremer cost savings and typical seasonal factors in the first quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/21/old-national-onb-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ONB 2026 Q1","e":"onb","d":"2026-04-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"James Ryan","x":"We are also accelerating efficiency and scalability through technology 